      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 14:30 and to bed; at the Drover's Rest from about 19:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the mill from about 08:30; home around 14:30 and to bed; back at the Drover's Rest from about 20:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
