      "key": "K0046",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:19 I passed through the square; from about 14:30 to 19:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 19:09 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:13 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:14 I passed through the square; around 08:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:30 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:19 I passed through the square; from about 14:30 to 20:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 20:10 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:09 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "ida",
       "selma"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0047",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Ida told me there's bad blood between them and Selma \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:ida",
       "person:selma",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
