      "key": "K0097",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at home; around 09:19 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:08 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:00 I was at the clinic; around 17:04 I passed through the square; from about 17:00 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:16 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
