      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0125",
      "key": "K0126",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:03 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:05 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:12 I passed through the square; around 22:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 16:18 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
