      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 17:00 I was at the workshop; around 17:06 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:15 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:11 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:16 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:19 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
