      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; home around 10:30; at the Drover's Rest from about 11:30; home around 23:15 and to bed; on Day 24 back at the Drover's Rest from about 11:30; home around 23:30 and to bed.",
