      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:13 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:08 I passed through the square; around 07:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:18 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
