      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:00 I was at home; around 09:04 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 11:15 I was at Mill Road; from about 11:15 to 12:00 I was at home; around 12:06 I passed through the square; from about 12:15 to 13:00 I was at the grocery; around 13:05 I passed through the square; from about 13:00 to 14:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 14:08 I passed through the square; from about 14:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:10 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:17 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:07 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 09:00 I was at the grocery; around 09:04 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:00 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:05 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
