      "in": "K0343",
      "key": "K0344",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at home; around 09:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:23 I passed through the square; from about 09:30 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; around 17:09 I passed through the square; around 17:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:18 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; around 17:11 I passed through the square; around 17:17 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 32220,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
